671	842	Political career
Bjerregaard was a member of the Danish parliament (Folketinget) from 21 September 1971 to 22 January 1995 and from 20 November 2001 until 8 February 2005.
843	930	She was a minister of various cabinets under Anker Jørgensen, and Poul Nyrup Rasmussen.
